# Talkwer motion contract

## Animation baseline

- Use helpers from `@/lib/useGsap` for ScrollTrigger lifecycle safety.
- Prefer `useGsapContext` for scoped setup and automatic cleanup.
- Always clean up via context revert on unmount.
- Keep animation values unchanged during refactors (duration/ease/start/end).

## Hook decision rule

- Use `useGsapContext` for all GSAP/ScrollTrigger section animations.
- Use plain `useEffect` only for non-GSAP side effects.

## Accessibility

- Respect reduced-motion with `prefersReducedMotion()`.
- Skip non-essential animation when reduced-motion is enabled.

## Performance

- Avoid duplicate ScrollTrigger registrations in component trees.
- Keep timeline creation scoped to the section refs.

